<title>USA: Nine-day system RPs totaled $12.095 bln -- Fed.</title>
<headline>Nine-day system RPs totaled $12.095 bln -- Fed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added $12.095 billion to the banking system during its round of nine-day fixed-system repurchase agreements on Tuesday, a spokeswoman at the New York Fed confirmed.</p>
<p>(( --N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
